          "transformation": "Clause (b)(v) adds any non-cash charge; for this period that is goodwill and intangible impairment. No single concept carries it and neither sparse concept has a fact in all four quarters, because Teleflex tags them only in quarters with a non-zero amount, so no TTM window can be built mechanically. Hand-summed from the filings: goodwill impairment 240,000 thousand in Q4 FY2024 (GoodwillImpairmentLoss, accession 0000096943-25-000031) and intangible impairment 5,724 thousand in Q4 FY2024 and 8,117 thousand in Q2 FY2025 (ImpairmentOfIntangibleAssetsExcludingGoodwill, accessions 0000096943-26-000019 and 0000096943-26-000095), with nil reported in Q3 FY2024 and Q1 FY2025. Total 253,841 thousand."
